    "title": "Three injured in two-vehicle crash in airport area: MPD - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MEMPHIS, Tenn. — Police are investigating a two-vehicle accident in the airport area where a man was critically injured and two women were injured Wednesday night. At 8:14 p.m., officers responded to a two-vehicle accident at Millbranch Road and Noncannah Road. Police said one man was transported to the hospital in critical condition and two women were transported to nearby hospitals, both in non-critical condition. They say northbound traffic is blocked currently, and this is an ongoing investigation. If you have any information that could help police, call CrimeStoppers at 901-528-CASH. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WREG.com.",
